# Phase 9A: excludes everything not explicitly COPYed by Dockerfile.
# This file governs only the Docker build context -- it does not change
# this project's own .gitignore policy, and nothing here is removed
# from Git tracking.

# Version control
.git/
.github/

# Secrets and local-only configuration -- never enters any build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Local-only data/cache (already .gitignore'd, excluded here too as a
# second, independent layer of defense against an accidental copy)
TeamDump/
cache/
sr_cache_html/
data/
logs/
covers_slug_cache.json
*.parquet
NCAA-Player-Radars/

# Generated card/image artifacts -- not needed by any of the 3 runtime images
PlayerCards/
Conference_Ratings/
Live Scoreboard/
Images/

# Notebooks -- not executed by, or required by, any accepted runtime process
*.ipynb
!cbb_teamScrape_v15_TEST.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/
Reference Py Files/
!Reference Py Files/net_rankings_2026.csv

# Streamlit pages: allowlist semantics -- only the three accepted, tracked
# pages (10-12) may enter an image. Pages 01-09 are untracked/deferred
# (page 04 execs the notebook card engine, page 09 triggers the live
# Odds/agent pipeline) and would otherwise ship from any dirty working tree.
pages/0*.py
pages/__pycache__/

# Tests, docs, and scratch/unknown-provenance files
tests/
docs/*
!docs/sr_slug_reconciliation.json
*.txt
!requirements.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
!requirements-backup.txt
!constraints-release-py313.txt
*.zip
*.pdf
_ncaa_playwright_helper.py
napsedge_discord_bot.py

# Virtual environments / caches
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/

# Deferred/excluded source modules this Phase 9A scope never builds or runs
# (left in the Git tree, simply never needed by any of the 3 images'
# own COPY list above -- excluding them here is defense in depth, not
# a correctness requirement, since the Dockerfile never COPYs the
# repository root wholesale).

# Host-generated Python bytecode, at EVERY depth (Phase 9B-7A follow-up). A bare `__pycache__/` or `*.pyc` matches only
# at the context root, so nested caches from the build machine used to enter every image through `COPY src/`,
# `COPY alembic/` and `COPY pages/`. Kept LAST on purpose: a later `!` exception could otherwise re-include bytecode.
# This excludes only what the host wrote; bytecode that pip generates while installing dependencies inside the image
# is unaffected.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
